id=xiaomi_mifi_web
name=Android-Hotspot-Web
version=1.9.0-beta
versionCode=18103
author=chenchaosuperman
description=Local web hotspot management for rooted Android (KernelSU). Hotspot control, traffic quota, client management, MAC blacklist/whitelist, scheduling, SMS forward, Mihomo proxy, PushPlus/DingTalk/Bark notifications, hidden SSID, device diagnostics. Generic Android compatibility via Hotspot Compatibility Layer (capability-driven; system SoftApConfiguration as single source of truth; writes via Framework setSoftApConfiguration(config,packageName) Binder Bridge, AOSP signatures; hotspot on/off via system Tethering, cmd wifi only as OEM fallback). Verified: Xiaomi 14 / HyperOS 3 / Android 16 / KernelSU. v1.9.0-beta: Stability release — boot_id 区分手机重启/模块重启保留 desired、keepalive 依据 Framework 真实 SoftAP 状态恢复、Web status() 真实 8s AbortController 超时、代理状态按需刷新、结构化 HOTSPOT_START/STOP source 日志（基于 v1.8.2-beta stabilityfix 发布整理，核心热点/DHCP/NAT/路由/统计逻辑不变）。  v1.8.0-beta: Diagnostic export (one-click tar.gz with masked secrets: config passwords/subscriptions/SMS tokens, log token scrub), status.cgi missing-cache noise fixed (can't open spam), iptables traffic-chain FORWARD leftovers cleaned on hotspot stop (loop -C/-D), release.sh CHANGELOG regex fixed.  v1.7.9-beta: SoftApBridge callbacks use real AIDL Stub (ISoftApCallback), Modern Tethering rewritten to AIDL signatures (TetheringRequestParcel+IIntResultListener), IPv6 management fixed (IPT6 defined, fw6 per-interface), fixed mgmt IP 192.168.43.1 never falls back, hotspot iface detection via Tethering downstream/alias/cache, caps & state caches (supervisor-warmed, CGI read-only), frontend capability-driven disable + dynamic max clients, tablet 900px 4-col grid.  v1.7.8-beta: SoftAP state judged by Framework onStateChanged (10-14, failure reason 0 never a failure, final state wins), hotspot_get_state 4-tier priority (Bridge softap-state > dumpsys snapshot > tether-state > iface), SoftApBridge softap-state command, hotspot_stop refuses fake success, unified hotspotState (ON/STARTING/OFF/STOPPING/ERROR/UNKNOWN) in header & home, concise error text, tablet/desktop responsive layout (960/1200px, 6-col nav, full-row notices, responsive modal), dynamic max clients from SoftApCapability.  v1.7.7-beta: Compatibility & Reliability.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenchaosuperman-cell/Android-Hotspot-Web/main/update.json
